# Check text out with LF on every platform. public/_headers pins the inline
# JSON-LD <script> by SHA-256 of its exact bytes, so a CRLF checkout (Git for
# Windows' core.autocrlf default) hashes differently from what's deployed and
# breaks test/csp-hash.spec.ts and the pre-commit hash update.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
